A. Commit message:
smb: server: Fix building with GCC 15 for older version

B. Change summary:
Replaced the fixed-size character array `basechars` with a character pointer and used `strlen` to calculate its length, addressing the build error caused by GCC 15's -Werror=unterminated-string-initialization.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Low

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
diff --git a/fs/smb/server/smb_common.c b/fs/smb/server/smb_common.c
index 4e6f169fcf83b..f51cd0816b1a9 100644
--- a/fs/smb/server/smb_common.c
+++ b/fs/smb/server/smb_common.c
@@ -18,8 +18,8 @@
 #include "mgmt/share_config.h"
 
 /*for shortname implementation */
-static const char basechars[43] = "0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_-!@#$%";
-#define MANGLE_BASE (sizeof(basechars) / sizeof(char) - 1)
+static const char *basechars = "0123456789ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ_-!@#$%";
+#define MANGLE_BASE (strlen(basechars) - 1)
 #define MAGIC_CHAR '~'
 #define PERIOD '.'
 #define mangle(V) ((char)(basechars[(V) % MANGLE_BASE]))
```